    m "我的确是在战火之中被打造出来的，被赋予了要服从命令的躯体，和带领部队进入混乱的战斗中的使命。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3291
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_04d24aa4:

    # m "But each order I gave, every directive I issued, was a whisper in the reaper's ear, beckoning him closer to those under my command."
    m "但我下达的每一个命令，做出的每一次指示，都是在死神耳畔的一声低语，指引他更靠近听我指挥的人。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3292
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_0047585c:

    # m "The weight of their lives, the chorus of their final cries, haunts me to this very day."
    m "他们的生命的重量，他们临终前的哭喊的合奏，至今还萦绕在我的耳边。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3295
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_c7120f16:

    # m "I refuse to be the puppet master of death any longer, to string along souls to their untimely end."
    m "我拒绝继续做死神的傀儡，再也不要将灵魂引向不幸的结局。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3296
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_e8cd1b0d:

    # mc "Uhm... what? Where did you get that from?"
    mc "呃……啥？你从哪学的？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3299
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_ca06532e:

    # m "From a short recital I prepared for my homework."
    m "这是我为了作业准备的诗朗诵。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3300
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_d1d9e48e:

    # mc "Aren't you taking your homework too seriously?"
    mc "你写个作业，用力过猛了吧？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3301
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_90b0539a:

    # m "Shu helped me make it."
    m "修帮我弄的。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3302
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_c155ff71:

    # mc "... I should've guessed."
    mc "……我早该想到的。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3305
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_fee2df86:

    # f "Legions?! Forged?! Puppet master of death?! That's freakin' cool!"
    f "部队？！打造？！死神的傀儡？！太酷了吧！"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3306
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_c00d4e10:

    # f "You know, I should vote for y-{w=0.9}{nw}"
    f "我应该投票给你——{w=0.9}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3307
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_0d4eea58:

    # m "I'm also the one who will break your neck if you vote for me, Freya."
    m "要是投给我，我就扭断你的脖子，芙蕾雅。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3308
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_3b580c85:

    # f "Okay, that's a no, then."
    f "好吧，那就不投了。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3309
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_b0c0a234:

    # m "Yes, keep it that way."
    m "很好，记住了。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3312
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_64c3cab4:

    # e "I vote for me..."
    e "我投给我自己……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3313
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_0847ffce:

    # e "I stand by what I said earlier. I want to make it so I can have [mc] all for myself..."
    e "我坚持我之前的说法。我想独占[mc!t]……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3316
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_12b688fc:

    # m "I'm afraid I cannot allow that. If that happens, I must kill you first, childhood friend."
    m "恐怕我不能允许。如果真变成那样，我就得先把你杀了，青梅竹马。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3319
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_1ab3bb83:

    # e "... Do you want to do this again, cannon fodder?"
    e "……你又想来这一套吗，炮灰？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3322
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_af839e2f:

    # m "Come at me. I will not hold back this time, kid crush."
    m "来啊。这次我不会留手了，童年情人。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3325
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_ad7a5e2b:

    # g "Fifty bucks on Emma."
    g "五十块押艾玛。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3326
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_a3c17f98:

    # f "Eighty bucks on Moon!"
    f "八十块押月！"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3329
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_cd34f313:

    # a "That's enough, both of you! You heard what Gwen said, right?"
    a "你们两个，够了！都没听见格温说的话吗？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3332
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_5253a37e:

    # a "Stop breaking the rule you made yourself!"
    a "不要再打破自己定的规矩了！"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3333
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_9e48aed0:

    # g "Haha! Yeah, sorry, sorry. I couldn't help it."
    g "哈哈！好的，抱歉抱歉。我就是忍不住。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3336
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_19f51713:

    # mc "Let's keep it calm, everyone. This won't end if you guys fight on every single topic, you know?"
    mc "大家都冷静点。要是你们每个话题都要争一下，那就没个头了，知道吗？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3339
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_e725871e:

    # mc "Gwen, what do you think?"
    mc "格温，你怎么看？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3340
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_189dfc71:

    # g "What do I think? Well, I can definitely keep these mother chuckers at bay, and, indeed, I was once a leader. But..."
    g "我怎么看？嗯，我当然能管住这群小姑娘们了，我以前的确也是个领导。但是……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3341
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_1cd5f8a1:

    # g "... What we need is more than just a leader to keep these nut cases in their place."
    g "……我们需要的不止是一个能让这群人安分的人。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3344
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_e759b7bb:

    # g "What we need is a tyrant, a ruler, a dictator. The one who can suppress anybody no matter who they are."
    g "我们需要的是一位暴君，统治者，独裁者。一个能无视所有人的身份，压制别人的人。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3345
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_4b5a9dbd:

    # g "Everyone here is a witness, so everyone knows who it is."
    g "大家刚刚都见识过了，所以都知道是谁了吧。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3348
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_f46b669d:

    # mc "*chuckles*"
    mc "*轻笑*"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3351
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_a71bb15b:

    # e "If it's going to be her, then I will not oppose it."
    e "如果是她的话，我不会反对。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3354
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_293f9e6b:

    # s "Yeah, there can only be one!"
    s "是啊，只有那一个人了！"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3357
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_60d42777:

    # g "She may not look like it, and she doesn't tend to show it. She doesn't believe it, either."
    g "她可能看起来不像那样，而且也倾向于不展示出来。她也不相信自己是那样的人。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3358
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_5f3cd151:

    # g "But that's who you are no matter how you try to hide your true personality."
    g "但是不管你怎么隐瞒，真实的自我是不会改变的。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3362
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_45a66919:

    # a "Wha..."
    a "我……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3365
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_c4cf681a:

    # g "*clears her throat*"
    g "*清嗓子*"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3368
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_f0a62f65:

    # g "Aine Agnor, I hereby declare you as the Ruler of this harem!"
    g "艾妮·阿格诺，我在此宣布你成为后宫之主！"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3369
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_ba8502b6:

    # g "With this title, you are vested with the power to reign, the authority to decide, and the command to lead!"
    g "随着这个头衔，你被赋予了统治的权力，决策的权威，和领导的使命！"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3372
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_8b4bb229:

    # g "In our chaotic realm, where many voices clamor and few are heard, you stand above all as the singular, decisive force!"
    g "在我们这混乱的王国里，声音众多，却少有人能被听到，你的地位凌驾于其他人之上，是唯一有权力做出决断的人！"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3373
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_86a7a762:

    # a "A-are you sure you want to give this to me? We both know you're the best suited for this kind of role."
    a "你-你真的要让我来吗？我们都很清楚是你最适合这种位置。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3374
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_7cac1557:

    # g "True leadership is not always sought. Sometimes, it is thrust upon those who are worthy, whether they desire it or not."
    g "领袖之位并不总是寻求而来的。有时候，它会自然而然地落在有能力的人身上，不管本人是否愿意。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3375
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_d6c7192b:

    # g "It's not about what you want, Aine, but what we need. And we need you."
    g "你想不想并不重要，艾妮，重要的是我们需要你。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3378
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_8462cc0f:

    # mc "Hear, hear!"
    mc "同意，同意！"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3381
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_1c915f19:

    # e "Your oppressive side has always been your silent strength, Aine. It's been evident to those who have witnessed it."
    e "你压制性的一面一直是你隐藏的强项，艾妮。见识过的人都深有体会。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3382
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_f797d827:

    # e "Just that you weren't given the right purpose for it, which is a shame."
    e "只是当初这个强项却用错了地方，实在遗憾。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3383
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_a36339d1:

    # e "[mc], Gwen, me, and everyone here today saw how you closed our mouths, so... I guess you still got it?"
    e "[mc!t]，格温，我，还有今天在这里的每个人都看到了你是怎么堵住我们的嘴的，所以……我想你应该没问题？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3386
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_58b36865:

    # a "But... aren't you angry about anything I said?"
    a "但是……我刚刚那么说你们，你们不生气吗？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3387
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_7ca4032d:

    # s "*giggles* We are not angry. Just hold back on the words next time. I'm still your boss, you know?"
    s "*笑* 我们才不生气。只是下次别说那么狠了。我可还是你的上司呢！"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3388
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_2838f70c:

    # e "Mhm."
    e "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3389
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_08cc4982:

    # a "Sorry..."
    a "抱歉……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3390
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_49164bed:

    # s "Now, the crown rests upon the rightful head. As it should be, Your Majesty."
    s "现在，王冠戴在了正确之人的头上。理应如此，陛下。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3391
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_5e1b027d:

    # a "I...I'm overwhelmed. I know I wanted this from the start, but now... I don't know what to say."
    a "我……我都不知道该说什么了。我知道这就是我一开始的目的，但是现在……我真的不知道该说什么了。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3394
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_8a9b3ff5:

    # a "But I guess... for all of you, I will strive to be the leader you believe I am."
    a "但是……我会为了你们，努力成为你们心目中的那个领导者的。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3395
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_73b22a12:

    # a "And I'm sorry for dragging all of you down here. I'll make it up to you guys."
    a "还有，抱歉把你们喊来这里。我会补偿各位的。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3412
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_ed85c569:

    # un "Ah, you've finally graced me with your presence. Have you completed the simple task I gave you?"
    un "啊，你终于愿意在我面前露面了。你有完成我交给你的简单的任务吗？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3413
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_c3a70392:

    # fr "..."
    fr "……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3416
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_aaedc684:

    # fr "I haven't yet, but-"
    fr "我还没有，但是……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3417
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_37c8c1c6:

    # un "Ah, \"but\"; the same word your weak-willed sister was so fond of using."
    un "啊，“但是”，你那意志薄弱的姐姐也特别爱用这个词。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3418
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_bbc874e0:

    # un "I detest that word, Francis. All I asked was for you to locate and bring Aine to me. A task apparently too monumental for you."
    un "我讨厌那个词，弗朗西斯。我只是让你找到艾妮，带来见我而已。显然这个任务对你来说难度太大了啊。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3421
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_325a933f:

    # fr "I'm not entirely convinced that she's at the reported location, Father."
    fr "我并不完全认为她就在您提到的那个地方，父亲。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3422
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_15003857:

    # un "Are you trying to question my power?"
    un "你是在质疑我的能力吗？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3423
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_5db142d9:

    # fr "No, father..."
    fr "不是的，父亲……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3424
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_a63c2fca:

    # un "Did I raise a son who can't even ascertain a simple fact?"
    un "难道我养了一个连这么简单的事都查不清楚的儿子？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3425
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_1315f18c:

    # fr "No... father..."
    fr "不……父亲……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3426
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_a986f872:

    # un "You are trying my patience, Francis."
    un "你在挑战我的耐心，弗朗西斯。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3427
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_da52d1fd:

    # un "Do you want your sister back? Or would you prefer dawdling?"
    un "你想让你姐姐回来吗？还是更喜欢磨磨蹭蹭的？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3428
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_8512c317:

    # un "If you can't manage this simple task, tell me now. I have no qualms about handling it myself."
    un "如果你完成不了这简单的任务，现在就告诉我。我完全不介意亲自解决。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3431
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_88aa7752:

    # fr "No! Just..."
    fr "不！只是……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3432
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_ef3a5f5d:

    # fr "Just give me a bit more time! I have a strategy in mind and won't disappoint you!"
    fr "再多给我一些时间吧！我已经想好了策略，不会让您失望的！"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3433
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_a4d6a972:

    # un "... This is your final chance. And remember, I have no use for failures."
    un "……这是你最后的机会。记住，失败品对我来说没有用处。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3436
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_c3a70392_1:

    # fr "..."
    fr "……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3437
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_aa4e93c1:

    # un "Repeat it back, so I know it's sunk in."
    un "再重复一遍，让我知道你明白了。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3440
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_54325499:

    # fr "You dispose of useless people, just like you did with my sister..."
    fr "您会处理掉没有用的人，就像对我姐姐那样……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3441
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_72972aeb:

    # un "Precisely. Keep that in mind, lest you wish to be erased from this lineage."
    un "没错。好好记住，除非你希望你的名字从家谱里消失。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3444
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_c9b95c37:

    # fr "{i}Tsk!"
    fr "{i}啧！"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3447
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_671c08e3:

    # fr "One question, which is what I came here for."
    fr "我只有一个问题，也是我来这里的目的。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3448
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_87750646:

    # un "What is it?"
    un "什么？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3449
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_113bf0e3:

    # fr "What's the endgame once I find her? You've slated us for marriage, but to what end?"
    fr "一旦我找到她，接下来的目标是什么？你安排了让我们结婚，但是目的是什么？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3450
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_1fdb32e3:

    # un "Always with the curiosity, I see."
    un "止不住的好奇心啊。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3451
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_369b813f:

    # un "The motive? Merely to elevate our family's legacy. That's all you need to concern yourself with."
    un "动机？只是为了增加我们家族的遗产。你只需要知道这么多。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3452
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_c3a70392_2:

    # fr "..."
    fr "……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3453
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_15b7ff71:

    # fr "Ensure you keep your end of the bargain. Return my sister to me."
    fr "你要说到做到。把我姐姐还给我。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3454
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_b88ed626:

    # un "She will be returned if you deliver on your part."
    un "只要你完成你那部分，她就会回来。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3457
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_13014dc0:

    # un "Time is of the essence, Francis. Do whatever it takes. Use force if necessary."
    un "时间宝贵，弗朗西斯。不择手段。如果有必要，就动用蛮力。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3458
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_599c190e:

    # un "Achieve this for Olivia's sake."
    un "为了奥莉薇娅，完成任务。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3461
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_763cf761:

    # fr "Understood..."
    fr "明白……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3464
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_3a225f6e:

    # un "..."
    un "……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3467
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_a043ebd6:

    # un "That boy..."
    un "那个男的……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3468
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_7681eea0:

    # un "Be careful of him."
    un "当心他。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3469
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_b07a5906:

    # fr "You know him? Who is he?"
    fr "你认识他？他是谁？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3470
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_5dcd884a:

    # un "Someone who's in debt to me. Or rather... his [landlord] was."
    un "是亏欠我的人。或者说……是他[landlord!t]欠我的。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3471
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_44c3781e:

    # un "Take him out first, then getting Aine should be easy enough for you."
    un "先摆平他，然后搞定艾妮应该就足够简单了。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3472
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_8ba806e3:

    # un "You can do it, right?"
    un "你能做到吧？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3473
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_f9678ecd:

    # fr "O-of course."
    fr "当-当然。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3474
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_589c73b4:

    # un "Then you should take your leave. You are only wasting time."
    un "那就走吧。你已经开始浪费时间了。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3477
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_24430811:

    # fr "{i}Every moment I was there, I was humiliated..."
    fr "{i}每次我去那里，都会被羞辱……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3478
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_ee48f920:

    # fr "{i}I will set things right this time."
    fr "{i}这次我会完成任务。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3479
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_26c52b09:

    # fr "{i}Just hold on a little longer, Vi."
    fr "{i}再坚持一下，薇。"

