    # yt "Still... Aine's fire is something else."
    yt "不过……艾妮的怒火真是难得一见。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3225
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_72903213:

    # yt "Seeing her all riled up just for me is That's insane."
    yt "看到她为了我气成那样真是爽啊。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3228
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_2672046f:

    # yt "And Gwen... will always be my queen. Full of life, full of surprises."
    yt "而格温……永远都是我的女王。充满了乐子，充满了惊喜。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3229
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_8bf82bdb:

    # yt "Just when I think I've figured her out, she flips the script again."
    yt "就在我觉得我已经弄懂她的时候，又能给我整出来新花样。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3230
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_9b785f2c:

    # yt "She gave up everything to be part of this—how could I not respect that?"
    yt "就凭她放弃了一切只为来搞后宫计划，就值得我所有的敬意。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3234
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_7a5df21f:

    # yt "God... the look on their faces..."
    yt "天啊，她们脸上的表情……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3237
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_2190c39c:

    # yt "Emma and I go way back. So many memories."
    yt "我跟艾玛有太多回忆了。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3238
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_5686b917:

    # yt "Seeing her open up like this is like watching someone you love finally step into the light."
    yt "看到她这样敞开心扉，就像看到自己爱的人终于站在聚光灯下。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3239
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_fcf7196f:

    # yt "*chuckles* That's it, Em. You belong here. Let them see who you really are."
    yt "*笑* 就是这样，小艾。你属于这里。让她们瞧瞧你真正的样子。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3242
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_cdba4315:

    # yt "And then there's Sky..."
    yt "然后是斯凯……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3243
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_4871087b:

    # yt "She's always been my anchor. The one person I could count on when everything else fell apart."
    yt "她一直是我的港湾。是其他一切都分崩离析的时候，我可以指望的人。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3244
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_6fc6b27c:

    # yt "Now she's out there, standing her ground—fighting for what she wants. So... her."
    yt "现在她正在为自己想要的东西奋战。真是……太像她了。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3247
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_3e3f9f28:

    # yt "Freya—the sharp one. The one who always seems five steps ahead."
    yt "芙蕾雅——爱出鬼点子的。总是能领先别人五步。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3248
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_6b0f8ff4:

    # yt "She sees the world differently. And now? Now she's laying it all out there like she's been saving it for the perfect moment."
    yt "她看世界的方式和其他人不一样。而现在，她正用尽全力，好像一直在为这一刻积蓄力量一样。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3249
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_9db49d56:

    # yt "*chuckles* Guess this was the moment she was waiting for."
    yt "*笑* 看来她的确一直在等这一刻。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3252
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_f8113065:

    # yt "And then..."
    yt "然后……"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3253
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_02d60b3b:

    # yt "There's this one girl."
    yt "还有这个姑娘。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3254
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_34576227:

    # yt "We haven't known each other long, but there's something about her... something strange. Like a thread pulling us together."
    yt "我们认识的时间不算久，可我总感觉她……有点奇怪。好像有根线把我们两个连在一起。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3255
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_3c7bc1a5:

    # yt "When she's not around, something in me feels... off. Like I'm missing a part I didn't know I had."
    yt "她不在的时候，我心里就会……有些空荡荡的。好像我缺失了一部分自我。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3256
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_adba3a77:

    # yt "I'm not talking about love or attraction. It's deeper than that. Like... an odd connection. I wonder if she can feel it too."
    yt "我不是在说爱或者仰慕。是更深的东西。一种……奇怪的联系。不知道她会不会也有这种感觉？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3257
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_1bd5aeb7:

    # yt "Even after learning about her past... it only left me with more questions."
    yt "哪怕知道了她的过去……也只让我有更多的问题。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3258
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_5c5b3405:

    # yt "Moon... who are you, really?"
    yt "月……你到底是谁？"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3266
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_275c7371:

    # yt "I still can't believe they're all doing this—for me."
    yt "我还是不敢相信她们会为了我做这种事。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3267
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_1720916e:

    # yt "It's overwhelming. Honestly? I'm flattered. But it's... a lot."
    yt "实在太震撼了。说实话，我受宠若惊。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3268
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_e1d38422:

    # yt "What I *do* know is that each of them holds a place in my heart."
    yt "我很清楚，她们每个人在我心里都有一席之地。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3269
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_2ca8b816:

    # yt "Never thought I'd find myself in a moment like this."
    yt "从来没想过我会遇上这种事。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3270
translate chinese freyastitchcosplay_14628280:

    # yt "Life really doesn't stop throwing curveballs, huh?"
    yt "看来生活总是充满惊喜啊。"

# game/ch1ep3.rpy:3471
translate chinese freyafirstarcend_434e9963:

    # un "Someone who's in debt to me. Or rather... the person who took him was."
    un "是亏欠我的人。或者说……是收养他的人欠我的。"

